# What a Crew release pins for its Flatcar boxes (docs/crew_spec.md
# §12.1, §12.3): the first-boot Flatcar, the Tailscale system extension
# the Ignition installs, and vfkit for the mac-vm launcher. Flatcar keeps
# a box current after its first boot; these only decide where it starts.
#
# The single source: the control plane compiles it into the Ignition
# (Crew.Boxes.Flatcar) and fills the launchers (/agent/linux-vm.sh,
# /agent/mac-vm.sh) from it. KEY=value, no quotes, no spaces. Bumping any
# of these is a supply-chain review (§20.4).

# Flatcar Container Linux, stable. The SHA-512s are from the release's
# signed DIGESTS files (flatcar_production_image.bin.bz2.DIGESTS and
# flatcar_production_image.vmlinuz.DIGESTS, under
# https://stable.release.flatcar-linux.net/<arch>-usr/<version>/), the
# verity hashes from its flatcar_production_image_verity.txt.
